---
// Fold 1 — Hero. One live conversation → floating insight, linked by threads.
---

<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="shell hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">NeoCore for Enterprise</span>
      <h1 class="display hero__h">
        Make frontline sales conversations
        <span class="mark">visible<svg viewBox="0 0 200 12" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8 C 50 2, 150 2, 197 7"/></svg></span>,
        <span class="b">measurable</span> and actionable.
      </h1>
      <p class="lede hero__lede">
        Measure pitch adherence, identify coaching priorities and hear the Voice of
        Customer, across teams, regions and languages.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <button type="button" class="pill pill-lg" data-lead-open data-evt="hero_cta_click" data-evt-source="hero">
          Talk to our enterprise team <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </button>
        <a href="#sample-analysis" class="tlink" data-evt="sample_analysis_link" data-evt-source="hero">See a sample analysis</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero__proof">
        <li>100+ languages</li>
        <li>Under 2-minute processing</li>
        <li>ISO 27001 certified</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="stage reveal" aria-label="Illustrative: a field conversation becoming management intelligence">
      <svg class="thread stage__thread" viewBox="0 0 520 540" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M300 150 C 430 150, 360 120, 486 98" />
        <path d="M335 215 C 445 245, 385 285, 466 305" />
        <path d="M300 265 C 430 375, 360 470, 486 484" />
      </svg>
      <div class="bubble stage__bubble">
        <div class="bubble__cap"><span class="live" aria-hidden="true"></span>Captured by Neo One · live</div>
        <p class="bubble__text">“Brand X offers a better margin. I’ll stock it <b>if your scheme improves.</b>”</p>
        <p class="bubble__who">Retailer · West region</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tagf stage__t1"><span class="ck">✓</span><span><b>Pitch adherence</b><em>4 / 5</em></span></div>
      <div class="tagf stage__t2"><span class="ck">✓</span><span><b>Coaching</b><em>Margin objection</em></span></div>
      <div class="tagf stage__t3"><span class="ck">✓</span><span><b>Voice of Customer</b><em>Competitor margin</em></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.02fr 0.98fr; gap: 30px; align-items: center; }
  .hero__h { margin-top: 18px; max-width: 14ch; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.4vw, 4rem); }
  .hero__lede { margin-top: 20px; }
  .hero__cta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; margin-top: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero__proof { display: flex; gap: 26px; margin-top: 28px; list-style: none; flex-wrap: wrap; color: var(--ink-3); font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .hero__proof li { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
  .hero__proof li::before { content: ""; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green); }

  .stage { position: relative; height: 540px; }
  .stage__thread { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: visible; pointer-events: none; }
  .stage__bubble { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 44px; width: 74%; z-index: 2; }
  .stage .tagf { position: absolute; z-index: 3; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .stage .tagf { animation: float 5.5s ease-in-out infinite; } }
  @keyframes float { 50% { transform: translateY(-8px); } }
  .stage__t1 { top: 66px; right: 1%; animation-delay: .1s; }
  .stage__t2 { top: 262px; right: 8%; animation-delay: .7s; }
  .stage__t3 { top: 452px; right: 0; animation-delay: 1.3s; }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .hero__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .stage { height: 460px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .stage__bubble { width: 80%; }
    .stage__t3 { top: 400px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .stage { height: 430px; }
    .stage__bubble { width: 92%; }
    .stage .tagf { padding: 10px 14px 10px 11px; }
    .stage__t1 { right: 0; top: 40px; } .stage__t2 { top: 250px; right: 4%; } .stage__t3 { top: 380px; }
    .pill-lg { width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; }
  }
</style>
